{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a relentless alien assault in <strong><i>Let Them Come: Onslaught</i></strong>, where bullet heaven gameplay collides with the gritty spirit of retro sci-fi classics.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges you to create the perfect build from an arsenal of over-the-top weapons and explosive upgrades\u2014shredding alien hordes in a display of retro-fueled chaos. If you\u2019re seeking <strong>a survivors-like experience</strong> with a vintage action movie vibe, set to the pulsing beat of a soundtrack by <strong><i>Cartridge 87</i></strong>, this game sets itself apart from the pack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ULTIMATE LOADOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.poster.avif?t=1760131664\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.webm?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.mp4?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose from a growing arsenal of ranged and area of effect weapons, from flamethrowers to orbital strikes and more. Each weapon unlocks new strategies and playstyles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REWARDING ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.poster.avif?t=1760131664\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.webm?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.mp4?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience, unlock powerful upgrades, and become stronger with every run. Experiment, refine your approach, and do some damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BULLET HEAVEN ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.poster.avif?t=1760131664\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.webm?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.mp4?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless alien swarms in procedurally generated arenas filled with hazards, escalating threats, and towering bosses. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK BY CARTRIDGE 87</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.poster.avif?t=1760131664\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.webm?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.mp4?t=1760131664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drive your onslaught forward with a pulse-pounding synth score designed to fuel the chaos.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2050800?t=1760131664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/4488839502ebe869f31e66c42c6ddaa46dd452e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760131664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/5c9e3a12b1cb69b0b824fa92859ef5f8f8a157a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760131664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/5c9e3a12b1cb69b0b824fa92859ef5f8f8a157a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760131664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features stylised depictions of frequent violence and gore. Players battle waves of alien enemies using sci-fi weapons, resulting in blood effects and dismemberment.\r\n\r\nThere is no sexual content, drug use, or strong language in the game."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2575650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a relentless alien assault in <strong><i>Let Them Come: Onslaught</i></strong>, where bullet heaven gameplay collides with the gritty spirit of retro sci-fi classics.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges you to create the perfect build from an arsenal of over-the-top weapons and explosive upgrades\u2014shredding alien hordes in a display of retro-fueled chaos. If you\u2019re seeking <strong>a survivors-like experience</strong> with a 